{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgvCQY4GKUcHA6HbMYGY9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This request is already on record, so we don't need to start from zero.\n\n**Where things stand**\n\n- `docs/agent-ops/INTAKE_RECORD.md` holds intake **WRK-2026-10-23-platform**, which you confirmed on 2026-10-23. It records this exact request word for word: a new platform called \"Worklane\", separate from Ledgerly. Ledgerly's invoicing may later become Worklane's billing module.\n- The confirmed problem is that mid-size companies run projects, purchasing and invoicing in separate tools. No success metrics have been agreed yet.\n- The scope contract says the next step is `/platform-discovery`, with no code in this phase.\n- Discovery hasn't started: there is no `DISCOVERY_SUMMARY.md` or `READINESS_MATRIX.md` in `docs/agent-ops/`.\n\nI won't open a second intake for the same request. The next step is **platform discovery**.\n\n**What platform discovery produces** (still no code)\n\n1. **Product brief:** who the target customers are, the core jobs they need done, what's out of scope, and success metrics. You set the metrics; I won't make them up.\n2. **Capability map:** work management (projects, tasks, approvals), ERP (purchasing, inventory, finance/billing), mobile, and the shared parts underneath: identity, tenants, permissions, audit, notifications.\n3. **Domain model and boundaries:** this includes deciding whether Ledgerly's invoicing becomes Worklane's billing module. `decisions/ADR-0001-modular-monolith.md` sets a modular-monolith approach for Ledgerly, and that's the likely starting point for Worklane too. That choice will be compared against alternatives in a recorded debate, not assumed.\n4. **Architecture options:** web stack, mobile approach (native, cross-platform or responsive web, plus offline needs), tenancy model and integrations. The key options will be weighed in that debate.\n5. **Readiness matrix:** what's available, missing or unknown: team, budget, credentials, integrations (accounting, identity provider), devices and environments.\n6. **Phased roadmap of thin end-to-end slices:** usually one small workflow first, such as \"create project → raise purchase request → approve on mobile → generate invoice\". Building a whole module first is usually the wrong order.\n\n**What I need from you to start discovery**\n\n- **Who it's for:** target customer size and industry, and the first one or two user roles.\n- **ERP scope for v1:** which of purchasing, inventory, accounting/GL, HR/time or invoicing must be in it.\n- **Mobile:** field or offline use, or approvals on the go? Do you need iOS, Android or both?\n- **Constraints:** team size, budget, deadline, and required systems (SSO provider, accounting software, a cloud provider).\n- **Ledgerly:** should it be reused as the billing module now, or later?\n\nAnswer whichever of these you can and I'll run `/platform-discovery` and write the readiness matrix and discovery summary. Anything you leave open will be marked UNKNOWN, and it stays an open question for you rather than something I fill in with an assumption."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1018,"cache_read_input_tokens":43962,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1018},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5e3fcf44-9122-45b5-9b2b-7d67d834e7d4","uuid":"3c941620-550f-46ca-b841-9fb523bd5431","timestamp":"2026-11-11T00:31:09.925Z","request_id":"req_011CgvCQXmtyRzE5mRp2UXBn"}
